Launch:
ros2 launch plato2_hardware_interface plato2_finger_hardware.launch.py 
ros2 run joint_position_controller position_control_node
	this is to set gains
	keep on soft or normal stiffness

Configure Zero:
open plato2.cpp
comment out 
	hand_->set_impedance_command(joint_effort_commands_, 100, 
		joint_position_states_, joint_velocity_states_);

uncomment
  // hand_->set_idle_command();
  // hand_->print_motor_positions();

rebuild package

rerun plato2_finger_hardware.launch.py
kill launch file

open actuator_config.hpp
edit motor offset in-order (hpp file numbering is not correct)
	no need to edit motor 1&2

recomment and uncomment in plato2.cpp
and rebuild


